#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "姐姐：Vika，妹妹：Vivi"
msgstr "Elder sister: Vika, Younger sister: Vivi"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
