msgstr "Female"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "外貌特点"
msgstr "Appearance Features"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "纯真可爱，两个人不管在哪里都手拉着手。喜欢可爱的小裙子和头饰。"
msgstr ""
"Pure and adorable, the two always hold hands wherever they go. Like cute "
"little dresses and hair accessories."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "体重／体型"
msgstr "Weight / Body Type"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "纤细，萝莉态"
msgstr "Slender, loli-type"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "职业"
msgstr "Occupation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "战士，输出凶猛，但因为二者总是并肩作战，容易被针对。"
msgstr ""
"Warriors, fierce damage output, but since the two always fight side by "
"side, they are easily targeted."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "技能"
msgstr "Skills"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "二人都活着的情况下可以互相补血如果一方死亡，可以激发活着的那个的被动技能，用生命为代价输出一个暴击。"
msgstr ""
"When both are alive, they can heal each other. If one dies, it triggers "
"the surviving one's passive skill, outputting a critical hit at the cost "
"of life."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "早期经历"
msgstr "Early Experience"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "（被植入的记忆）两人从小一起长大，在寄宿学校读书。经常遭受殴打和虐待。某一晚，姐姐带着妹妹逃离了那个可怕的地方，但身中一枪，所以姐姐胸前一直有绷带。姐姐的脾气很坏，妹妹有些叛逆。但关键时刻，妹妹很乖，愿意听姐姐的安排。在游戏世界徘徊了许久后，姐姐认为学院是一个突破口，即使妹妹不这么认为，但依然选择和姐姐在一起。"
msgstr ""
"(Implanted memories) The two grew up together, studying at a boarding "
"school. They frequently suffered beatings and abuse. One night, the elder"
" sister took the younger sister and escaped from that terrible place, but"
" was shot in the process, so the elder sister always has bandages on her "
"chest. The elder sister has a bad temper, and the younger sister is "
"somewhat rebellious. But at critical moments, the younger sister is very "
"obedient and willing to follow her sister's arrangements. After wandering"
" the game world for a long time, the elder sister believes the academy is"
" a breakthrough; even though the younger sister doesn't think so, she "
"still chooses to stay with her sister."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "遭受的失败"
msgstr "Failures Experienced"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "世界上姐姐已经死了，但游戏出现了BUG，姐姐一直以幽灵形态保护和陪伴妹妹。"
msgstr ""
"In the real world, the elder sister has already died, but a game bug "
"caused the elder sister to continue protecting and accompanying the "
"younger sister in ghost form."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "为什么"
msgstr "Why"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "在早年的流浪生涯中，姐姐因为保护妹妹“死去“了。却因为担心妹妹一直没有离开。所以姐姐的颜色比妹妹淡一些。可以看出是幽灵。"
msgstr ""
"During their early years of wandering, the elder sister \"died\" while "
"protecting the younger sister. But because she worried about her sister, "
"she never left. That's why the elder sister's colors are paler than the "
"younger sister's. You can tell she is a ghost."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "性格"
msgstr "Personality"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "姐姐暴躁，说一不二，妹妹逆来顺受但尚且乖巧。因为妹妹认为对姐姐有愧。"
msgstr ""
"The elder sister is hot-tempered and decisive; the younger sister is "
"resigned but still obedient. Because the younger sister feels she owes "
"the elder sister."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "未实现目标"
msgstr "Unfulfilled Goal"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "找到姐姐如此形态存在的原因。并解决。"
msgstr "Find the reason why the elder sister exists in this form, and resolve it."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "家庭信息"
msgstr "Family Information"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "仅有姐妹二人"
msgstr "Only the two sisters"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "爱好"
msgstr "Hobbies"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "打架，虽然个子小，但是力大无穷"
msgstr "Fighting, despite their small size, they possess boundless strength"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "怪癖／缺点"
msgstr "Quirks / Flaws"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "二人世界已经很满，加上二人身上有不能与外人说的秘密，所以对周围的一切不太在意。由于儿时的受虐经历，有一些反社会人格。"
msgstr ""
"Their world of two is already full, plus they carry secrets they cannot "
"share with outsiders, so they don't care much about their surroundings. "
"Due to childhood abuse, they have some antisocial personality traits."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "天赋"
msgstr "Talent"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "近战超强"
msgstr "Superior close combat"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "家族传统"
msgstr "Family Tradition"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "互相照顾"
msgstr "Taking care of each other"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "最害怕"
msgstr "Greatest Fear"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "姐姐被游戏世界回收"
msgstr "The elder sister being reclaimed by the game world"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "姐姐是一个没人能解释的BUG（幽灵）"
msgstr "The elder sister is an unexplainable bug (ghost)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "最强长处"
msgstr "Greatest Strength"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/vikagirls.md:22
msgid "对彼此的爱。流浪两年之后，由于出色的战斗经验和姐姐的高智商。破格成为军事学院的领导者。二人来军事学院视察，加入主角团的战斗。与政府人员大交道很厉害。喜欢打官腔。但因为是小孩子，反差萌"
msgstr ""
"Their love for each other. After two years of wandering, due to "
"outstanding combat experience and the elder sister's high IQ, they "
"exceptionally became leaders of the military academy. The two came to "
"inspect the military academy and joined the protagonist's group in "
"battle. Excellent at dealing with government officials. Like speaking in "
"bureaucratic tones. But because they are children, the contrast is "
"adorable."

